<title>TURKEY: Turkey sets first 13-mth bond auction for Tuesday.</title>
<headline>Turkey sets first 13-mth bond auction for Tuesday.</headline>
<dateline>ISTANBUL 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The central bank said the Treasury would auction on Tuesday the first ever 13-month bonds, after a nine-month t-bill auction on December 3.</p>
<p>    Maturity    : January 14, 1998</p>
<p>    Amount	: -</p>
<p>    Coupon	: -</p>
<p>Auction date: December 17, 1996</p>
<p>Value date  : December 18, 1996</p>
<p>-- Istanbul newsroom +90-212-275 08 75</p>
